      "reasons": [
        "narrow: The certificate \\(\\mathcal F_x^{\\mathrm{arg}}(p_x)\\) forces both value equality and optimizer-set equality.  Equality of argmin sets alone does not force equality of minima.  For example, the convex set \\(\\operatorname{conv}\\{(1,0,9/10),(0,1,9/10),(0,0,4/5),(0,0,1)\\}\\) and its coordinate rectangle both have the unique minimizer \\(e_2\\), while their regret values are respectively \\(1/10\\) and \\(1/5\\).  The proposed statement is the exact simultaneous-preservation equivalence proved by the definitions."
      ]
